{{#> layout
  title='Getting started with Vocably'
  url='/welcome-mobile-user.html'
}}
  <section class="ise-hero container-lg text-center">
    <span class="ise-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i> Getting started</span>
    <h1 class="ise-title">Welcome to Vocably</h1>
    <p class="ise-lead">
      Vocably is a dictionary and flashcards in one app. Look up the words you
      come across, save the ones you want to remember, and study them for a
      few minutes a day.
    </p>

    <ul class="wmu-overview">
      <li>
        <i class="bi bi-translate" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>Dictionary</h2>
        <p>See translations, pronunciation, and examples for any word or phrase.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>Save</h2>
        <p>Add the words you want to remember to your cards with one tap.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>Study</h2>
        <p>Spaced repetition brings each word back right before you’d forget it.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="ise-note wmu-safari-note hide-android">
      <i class="bi bi-apple" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <p>
        On iPhone, Vocably also works in Safari: select a word on any web page
        to translate it. <a href="/ios-safari-extension.html">Set up Vocably for Safari</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-lg">
    <h2 class="wmu-section-title">Build your word list</h2>

    <ol class="ise-steps">
      <li class="ise-step">
        <div class="ise-step-body">
          <span class="ise-step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
          <h2>Open the Dictionary tab</h2>
          <p>
            The first time you open Vocably, <strong>My cards</strong> is
            empty. Tap
            <strong class="text-nowrap"><i class="bi bi-translate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Dictionary</strong>
            at the bottom of the screen to find your first word.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="ise-step-media">
          <div class="wmu-pointer" style="--x: 37.4%; --y: 93.9%">
            <img src="assets/welcome/my-cards-empty.png" class="ise-phone" width="600" height="1304" alt="The empty My cards screen with the Dictionary tab at the bottom." loading="lazy" />
            <span class="wmu-pointer-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="wmu-pointer-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </li>

      <li class="ise-step">
        <div class="ise-step-body">
          <span class="ise-step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
          <h2>Choose your languages</h2>
          <p>
            At the top of the screen, tap the left button to pick the language
            you’re learning, and the right button to pick a language you
            already know.
          </p>
          <p class="ise-hint">
            In these screenshots, the learner studies Dutch and already speaks
            English.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="ise-step-media">
          <div class="wmu-pointer wmu-pointer-up" style="--x: 50%; --y: 10.7%; --ax: 74%; --rw: 96cqw; --rh: 14cqw">
            <img src="assets/welcome/dictionary.png" class="ise-phone" width="600" height="1304" alt="The Dictionary tab with Dutch on the left and English (US) on the right." loading="lazy" />
            <span class="wmu-pointer-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="wmu-pointer-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </li>

      <li class="ise-step">
        <div class="ise-step-body">
          <span class="ise-step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
          <h2>Look up a word you came across</h2>
          <p>
            Type the word in the search field and tap
            <i class="bi bi-search" aria-label="search"></i>. Vocably shows its
            translations, pronunciation, and examples.
          </p>
          <p>
            Tap <i class="bi bi-plus-circle wmu-icon" aria-label="plus"></i>
            to add the word to your cards.
          </p>
          <div class="ise-note">
            <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="hide-ios">
                <strong>On Android</strong>, you can select a word in any app
                and translate it with Vocably.
                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jNNurc9w7AY&t=9s" target="_blank">Watch how</a>
              </p>
              <p class="hide-android">
                <strong>On iPhone</strong>, you can translate words in Safari
                with <a href="/ios-safari-extension.html" target="_blank">Vocably for Safari</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="ise-step-media">
          <img src="assets/welcome/look-up-word.png" class="ise-phone" width="600" height="1304" alt="The Dutch word behoefte looked up, with its translation, examples, and the add button." loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </li>

      <li class="ise-step" id="reverse-translation">
        <div class="ise-step-body">
          <span class="ise-step-number" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
          <h2>Find the word you want to say</h2>
          <p>
            Don’t know how to say something in the language you’re learning?
            Type it in the language you know. Vocably detects the language
            automatically and shows the words you’re looking for.
          </p>
          <p>
            Pick the best matches and tap
            <i class="bi bi-plus-circle wmu-icon" aria-label="plus"></i>
            to save them.
          </p>
          <p class="ise-hint">
            Some words are spelled the same in both languages. To make Vocably
            search in the language you know, tap
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right wmu-icon" aria-label="switch languages"></i>
            between the two languages.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="ise-step-media">
          <img src="assets/welcome/autodetect.png" class="ise-phone" width="600" height="1304" alt="The English phrase to use typed in, with the Dutch words gebruiken and hanteren in the results." loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="wmu-section-title">Learn your words</h2>

    <ol class="ise-steps">
      <li class="ise-step">
        <div class="ise-step-body">
          <span class="ise-step-number" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
          <h2>Study every day</h2>
          <p>
            Open <strong>My cards</strong> and tap <strong>Study</strong>.
            Vocably shows the cards planned for today.
          </p>
          <p>
            Vocably uses spaced repetition (SRS). Each word comes back right
            before you’re likely to forget it. Words you know well show up
            less often, and the ones you struggle with come back sooner.
          </p>
          <ul class="ise-checklist">
            <li><i class="bi bi-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span><strong>A few minutes a day</strong> is enough. Short daily sessions work better than long ones once a week.</span></li>
            <li><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span><strong>Words move to long-term memory</strong>, so you remember them for months, not days.</span></li>
            <li><i class="bi bi-bullseye" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span><strong>No time wasted</strong> on words you already know.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <figure class="ise-step-media">
          <div class="wmu-pointer wmu-pointer-up" style="--x: 50%; --y: 16.4%; --ax: 89%; --rw: 94cqw; --rh: 14cqw">
            <img src="assets/welcome/study.png" class="ise-phone" width="600" height="1304" alt="My cards with the Study button and the cards planned for today." loading="lazy" />
            <span class="wmu-pointer-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="wmu-pointer-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="container-lg ise-help-section">
    <div class="ise-help">
      <i class="bi bi-envelope-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <div>
        <h2>Have a question?</h2>
        <p>
          Write to me at <a href="mailto:d@vocably.pro">d@vocably.pro</a>.
          I read and answer every email.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/layout}}
